nodes.body:
@guihong-nv Thanks for taking a look and reviewing the PR!

I have addressed your comments regarding the opt-in integration.

Also, we have released a new version of liger -- v0.8.1 (https://github.com/linkedin/Liger-Kernel/releases/tag/v0.8.1). When users install this version of liger (`pip install liger-kernel==0.8.1`), they will be able to use liger within megatron.

